  "description": "A comprehensive multi-target .NET utility library (.NET 6.0/7.0/8.0) for financial services, mobile money, EMV QR codes, with powerful extension methods. Includes StringExtensions (email/IP validation, hashing, conversions), CollectionExtensions (LINQ enhancements, batching, shuffling), ObjectExtensions (null handling, JSON/query string conversions), plus ValidationUtils (IBAN, credit cards, BIC/SWIFT), CryptographyUtils (AES/RSA encryption, PBKDF2), FileUtils (compression, MIME detection), DateTimeUtils, SerializationUtils, and 200+ countries/currencies support. Perfect for FinTech, mobile money, banking, and modern .NET applications.",
  "id": "KBA.CoreUtilities",
